| `traceability.matrix_path` | string | `.evidence/traceability/matrix.json` | a repo-relative file path, no `..`, not reached through a symlink, that `.gitignore` ignores | `scripts/trace_requirements.py` | Moves where `make trace` writes the matrix; a path git would list is refused with exit 2. | a committed matrix, which the command refuses: it is one tree's verdict, derived on every run | always |
